From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:00:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] GUIWindowVideo: leave video views without waiting on artwork

Leaving a video window joined its thumb loader on the GUI thread until a slow share answered. Stop it asynchronously on ordinary deactivation instead.

A window deactivated before shutdown receives no second deinit, so checking IsStopping there cannot provide the required join. The window manager does force-unload every window before deinitializing the texture cache. Join the loader from FreeResources(true), which covers inactive windows and skin reloads as well as shutdown.

VideoNav forwards deinit to VideoBase and needs no duplicate stop policy. Shared GUI code with no Amlogic counterpart.

Signed-off-by: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.cpp b/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.cpp
index 2584ba7256955a6c858e29eb5820f82f490fed40..6ed398a203ab98b6598c6fc32835aab407f9d5bd 100644
--- a/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.cpp
@@ -104,6 +104,14 @@ CGUIWindowVideoBase::CGUIWindowVideoBase(int id, const std::string &xmlFile)
 
 CGUIWindowVideoBase::~CGUIWindowVideoBase() = default;
 
+void CGUIWindowVideoBase::FreeResources(bool forceUnload)
+{
+  if (forceUnload)
+    m_thumbLoader.StopThread();
+
+  CGUIMediaWindow::FreeResources(forceUnload);
+}
+
 bool CGUIWindowVideoBase::OnAction(const CAction &action)
 {
   if (action.GetID() == ACTION_SCAN_ITEM)
@@ -131,8 +139,8 @@ bool CGUIWindowVideoBase::OnMessage(CGUIMessage& message)
   switch ( message.GetMessage() )
   {
   case GUI_MSG_WINDOW_DEINIT:
-    if (m_thumbLoader.IsLoading())
-      m_thumbLoader.StopThread();
+    // A forced resource unload joins it before the texture cache is deinitialized.
+    m_thumbLoader.StopAsync();
     m_database.Close();
     break;
 
diff --git a/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.h b/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.h
index d28757d5a8e89629f202b65f8805eeb63d737cb7..55adf8e46ab5200526f33f3c226e0ff1bc4c7ee6 100644
--- a/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.h
+++ b/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoBase.h
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ class CGUIWindowVideoBase : public CGUIMediaWindow, public IBackgroundLoaderObse
 public:
   CGUIWindowVideoBase(int id, const std::string &xmlFile);
   ~CGUIWindowVideoBase(void) override;
+  void FreeResources(bool forceUnload = false) override;
   bool OnMessage(CGUIMessage& message) override;
   bool OnAction(const CAction &action) override;
   bool OnPopupMenu(int iItem) override;
diff --git a/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoNav.cpp b/xbmc/video/windows/GUIWindowVideoNav.cpp
